%% title: Complete capture and reconciliation (ADR-0013)
%% desc: The mechanism that guarantees no article is missed.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant MO as morninger
  participant SC as scraper
  participant LG as discovered_urls
  participant RS as RawStore
  participant DB as monocle.db
  participant RC as reconcile
  MO->>SC: capture every 10 minutes, every active source
  SC->>SC: read the category list until a page is already fully known
  SC->>LG: record every URL before filtering
  SC->>RS: store the original page, exact bytes, SHA-256
  SC->>DB: write the article and mark it captured in one transaction
  Note over LG,DB: There is no dropped state. Duplicates are kept and counted.
  MO->>RC: reconcile sitemaps, at most every 30 minutes
  RC-->>MO: a gap above 2% in one day is RED
  RC->>SC: fetch deferred articles again and restore lost Bronze files
